    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror with a real life footage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning: This game contains some intense jumpscares.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- After looking for a job for a long time, you started as an operator in a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >company named &quot;Paranormal Inc.&quot; You will watch live CCTV footage and report the anomalies you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A very good blend of reality and paranormal observation duty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- With real life footages this horror game gets even more scarier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find and report unusual activity in the footages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Try to avoid sending false reports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Earn enough xp points to unlock next location</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Very realistic gameplay with real life footage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creepy and scary locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Supports many languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy: Less anomalies, shorter duty time, requires 60% success rate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Medium: Moderate anomaly count, average duty time, requires 70% success rate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hard: Much more anomalies, full duty time, requires 80% success rate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Subtitles option for those who can't hear noise/sound anomalies</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror with a real life footage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning: This game contains some intense jumpscares.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- After looking for a job for a long time, you started as an operator in a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >company named &quot;Paranormal Inc.&quot; You will watch live CCTV footage and report the anomalies you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A very good blend of reality and paranormal observation duty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- With real life footages this horror game gets even more scarier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find and report unusual activity in the footages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Try to avoid sending false reports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Earn enough xp points to unlock next location</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Very realistic gameplay with real life footage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creepy and scary locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Supports many languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy: Less anomalies, shorter duty time, requires 60% success rate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Medium: Moderate anomaly count, average duty time, requires 70% success rate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hard: Much more anomalies, full duty time, requires 80% success rate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Subtitles option for those who can't hear noise/sound anomalies</p>",
